# Setting up your project

Thanks for using Sprout to generate your application's scaffolding.

The generated code relies on a few libraries. All of them are **required**, so add them before your first build to make sure the project compiles right away.

## Required dependencies

- **Spring Data JPA**: the generated repositories are built on JPA repositories.
- **Spring Validation**: DTOs are validated with Bean Validation annotations, which the generated controllers use.
- **Lombok**: cuts boilerplate and keeps the code readable. Its annotations are used in every generated component except the mappers.
- **MapStruct**: generates the mappers at compile time, which reduces boilerplate and keeps the layers decoupled. Its annotations are used in the generated mappers.
- **A relational database driver** (PostgreSQL, MySQL, H2, ...): the generated code never references it directly, but Spring Data JPA cannot connect to your database without one.

## Maven

```xml
<dependencies>
    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
        <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-data-jpa</artifactId>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
        <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-validation</artifactId>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.projectlombok</groupId>
        <artifactId>lombok</artifactId>
        <optional>true</optional>
    </dependency>
    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.mapstruct</groupId>
        <artifactId>mapstruct</artifactId>
        <version>${mapstruct.version}</version>
    </dependency>
    <!-- Example driver: replace with the one matching your database -->
    <dependency>
        <groupId>org.postgresql</groupId>
        <artifactId>postgresql</artifactId>
        <scope>runtime</scope>
    </dependency>
</dependencies>
```

## Annotation processors

Lombok and MapStruct both run at compile time, and they must be registered in the right order. Otherwise the mappers may not see Lombok's generated getters and setters.

```xml
<plugin>
    <groupId>org.apache.maven.plugins</groupId>
    <artifactId>maven-compiler-plugin</artifactId>
    <configuration>
        <annotationProcessorPaths>
            <path>
                <groupId>org.projectlombok</groupId>
                <artifactId>lombok</artifactId>
                <version>${lombok.version}</version>
            </path>
            <path>
                <groupId>org.projectlombok</groupId>
                <artifactId>lombok-mapstruct-binding</artifactId>
                <version>${lombok-mapstruct-binding.version}</version>
            </path>
            <path>
                <groupId>org.mapstruct</groupId>
                <artifactId>mapstruct-processor</artifactId>
                <version>${mapstruct.version}</version>
            </path>
        </annotationProcessorPaths>
    </configuration>
</plugin>
```